INSERT INTO `bill_results` VALUES (1,3887,3897,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-02 17:08:50','Abdominal discomfort','The liver is normal sized   and showed normal parenchymal echoes and texture.  No focal hepatic mass lesion or collection demonstrated. The intrahepatic and extra hepatic vascular and biliary systems are within normal limits. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and sizes. They both showed normal echogenicity, good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes bilaterally.\r\nThe spleen is normal in size and show normal echopattern. No focal mass lesion seen. The pancreas is also normal in size and echopattern.  The para aortic area is free.\r\nThe demonstrated bowel loops appear grossly within normal limits.\r\nNo intra-abdominal collection seen. \r\nThe urinary bladder is moderately distended with clear urine and showed normal wall thickness. No calculus is demonstrated. \r\nThe uterus, adnexae and POD are within normal limits.','Essentially normal examination','completed','2026-08-02 17:08:50','2026-08-02 17:08:50','2026-08-02 17:08:50'),(2,3889,3899,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-02 17:48:04','MALARIA R/O UTI','Single live intrauterine fetus, in longitudinal lie and cephalic presentation currently.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular,\r\nAdequate liquor volume,\r\nPlacenta is anterior on the body.\r\nBPD = 88mm, FL = 72.3mm,\r\nEGA = 36 Weeks + 1 days,\r\nEDD = 29/08/2026\r\nThe internal os is closed.','Single viable intrauterine fetus at about 36 weeks + 1 day GA','completed','2026-08-02 17:48:04','2026-08-02 17:48:04','2026-08-02 17:48:04'),(3,3888,3898,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-02 18:29:28','Lower abdominal pain','There is multi-loculated heterogeneous mass lesion predominantly hypo-echoic with lobulated outline in the pelvic cavity seen occupying the both adnexae and POD. It bears medium level echoes with multiple sepatations. The largest pocket measures about 75x46mm in size. \r\nThe uterus is normal in size, empty and shows uniform myometrial echopattern. It measures about 34mm in widest AP diameter. It shows an intact endometrial plate echo.  No intracavitary collection or gestational sac is seen. \r\nThe liver is normal in size and shows homogenous echotexture. No focal mass lesion is noted. The gall bladder and the biliary tree are also within normal limits. \r\nThe spleen and pancreas show normal size, parenchymal echogenicity and texture with no focal lesion seen within. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and size. They also show normal echogenicity with good corticomedullary differentiation bilaterally. No renal calculus or back pressure effect is noted.\r\nThe bowel loops are normal in caliber and outline. No free intra-peritioneal fluid collection is seen. No intra-abdominal mass lesion or ascites is demonstrated. The appendix is not demonstrated.\r\nThe urinary bladder is normal in wall thickness and contained clear urine.','Features suggest pelvic cavity collection?? Hematoma.\r\nSerum PT is suggested to r/o ruptured ectopic.\r\n\r\nDRs. AMINU MB/ABDURRAHMAN Y.','completed','2026-08-02 18:29:28','2026-08-02 18:29:28','2026-08-02 18:29:28'),(4,3890,3900,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-02 18:37:17','Incomplete abortion','The uterus is bulky measuring about 55mm in AP diameter. It contains heterogeneous structures about 7.39ml in volume suggestive of product of conception. \r\nThe myometrial echoes are uniform. \r\nThe adnexae and POD are within normal limits. \r\nThe urinary bladder is also within normal limits.','Incomplete abortion','completed','2026-08-02 18:37:17','2026-08-02 18:37:17','2026-08-02 18:37:17'),(5,3891,3901,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-02 18:42:26','Fetal well-being','Single live intrauterine fetus, in transverse lie with fetal head to the right maternal spine side currently.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular,\r\nAdequate liquor volume,\r\nPlacenta is posterior on the body.\r\nBPD =30.3mm, FL = 23mm,\r\nEGA = 15 Weeks + 6 days,\r\nEDD = 18/01/