rmal limits. \r\nThe spleen is normal in size and show normal echopattern. No focal mass lesion seen. The pancreas is also normal in size and echopattern.  The para aortic area is free.\r\nThe demonstrated bowel loops appear grossly within normal limits. Marked bowel gass is noted in the left flank with probe pressure tenderness elicited. \r\nNo intra-abdominal collection seen. \r\nThe urinary bladder is moderately distended with clear urine and showed normal wall thickness. No calculus is demonstrated. \r\nThe prostate is within normal limits. It measures about 29ml in volume.','Features are suggestive of;\r\n1. Bilateral ectopic kidneys (Horse shoe) suprapubic (incidental finding)\r\n2. Possibility of intestinal obstruction. Plain abdominal x-ray (erect and supine) is suggested for further  evaluations.','completed','2026-08-20 17:07:47','2026-08-20 17:07:47','2026-08-20 17:07:47'),(775,4714,4725,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 17:11:14','???','LEFT ELBOW\r\nThe demonstrated bones show density, outline and cortico-medullary differentiation..\r\nThe projected joints show normal articular margins\r\nOverlying soft tissue fullness is noted over the elbow aspect and distal arm.\r\nNo abnormal radio-opacity projected.','Soft tissue swelling? cause','completed','2026-08-20 17:11:14','2026-08-20 17:11:14','2026-08-20 17:11:14'),(776,4704,4715,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 17:15:07','cyesis dating','Bulky uterus containing a single intact gestational sac with a fetal pole and yolk sac noted within it. \r\nCardiac pulsation is not demonstrated currently. \r\nGS  = 10.91mm   \r\nEGA= 05 weeks + 0 days \r\nEDD=22/04/2027\r\nInternal os is closed.   \r\nBoth adnexae and POD appear within normal limits.','Early intrauterine cyesis at about 05 weeks GA? Viability.\r\nRepeat the scan in 4-5 weeks\' time to ascertain the viability.','completed','2026-08-20 17:15:07','2026-08-20 17:14:27','2026-08-20 17:15:07'),(777,4712,4723,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 17:23:16','BPP/EFW','Single live intrau