mits.\r\nThe demonstrated glands show normal size, shape and echopattern. \r\nThe great vessels of the are within normal limits.','Features suggest left lower neck adenopathy. \r\nUltrasound guided FNAC/BIOPSY is suggested for further evaluations.','completed','2026-08-20 18:01:53','2026-08-20 18:01:53','2026-08-20 18:01:53'),(780,4696,4707,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 18:13:08','DKA','There is cardiomegaly CTR = 53%\r\nThe aorta is unfolded to an aneurismal extent with cephalization. \r\nNo focal lung parenchymal lesion seen\r\nRight costo-phrenic angle is blunted. The costo-phrenic angles are free\r\nNormal bony thorax and overlying soft tissue outline.','Features are suggestive of incipient heart failure.','completed','2026-08-20 18:13:08','2026-08-20 18:13:08','2026-08-20 18:13:08'),(781,4683,4694,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 18:51:40','?Right elbow dislocation','RIGHT ELBOW\r\nAllowing for abnormal position due to pain on the radiography.\r\nThe demonstrated bones show normal density and cortico medullary differentiation. \r\nThere is distortion of the joint axial relations with anterior displacement of the capitelum. The Joint surfaces are preserved. \r\nOverlying soft tissue swelling is noted over the elbow joint and distal arm.','Features are suggestive of right elbow joint dislocation.','completed','2026-08-20 18:51:40','2026-08-20 18:51:40','2026-08-20 18:51:40'),(782,4716,4727,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 19:16:57','Abdominal pain? Typhoid','There is excessive bowel gas in the central abdomen. However, the demonstrated bowel loops are dilated and show exaggerated peristalsis with to and fro movements of their contents. Mild free intra-peritoneal fluid collection is noted? reactionary. No mass lesion or lymph node is seen.\r\nThe liver is normal in size and echo pattern. The gall bladder contains clear content with regular wall thickness and outline. \r\nThe pancreas and para-aortic region are within normal limits.  \r\nThe spleen is normal in size and shows uniform parenchymal echoes and outline.\r\nThe kidneys are normal in size, shape, and outline. They also showed normal echogenicity and good cortico-medullary differentiation bilaterally. No calculus or back pressure effect is noted.\r\nThe urinary bladder is within normal limits.','Features are those of intestinal obstruction. \r\nPlain abdominal x-ray (erect and supine) are advised for further evaluation','completed','2026-08-20 19:16:57','2026-08-20 19:16:26','2026-08-20 19:16:57'),(783,4717,4728,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 19:28:28','MALARIA R/O UTI','Single live intrauterine fetus, in longitudinal lie and cephalic presentation currently.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular,\r\nAdequate liquor volume,\r\nPlacenta is posterior on the body.\r\nBPD = 51 mm, FL = 40mm,\r\nEGA = 22 Weeks + 0 days,\r\nEDD = 24/12/2026\r\nThe internal os is closed.','Single viable intrauterine fetus at about 22 weeks GA in satisfactory well-being','completed','2026-08-20 19:28:28','2026-08-20 19:28:28','2026-08-20 19:28:28'),(784,4718,4729,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 19:30:58','cyesis','Single live intrauterine fetus, in longitudinal lie and cephalic presentation currently.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular,\r\nAdequate liquor volume,\r\nPlacenta is posterior and fundal on the body.\r\nBPD = 85.2 mm, FL = 70.13 mm,\r\nEGA = 35 Weeks + 0 days,\r\nEDD = 24/09/2026\r\nThe internal os is closed.','Single viable intrauterine fetus at about 35 weeks  GA in satisfactory well being.','completed','2026-08-20 19:30:58','2026-08-20 19:30:58','2026-08-20 19:30:58'),(785,4719,4730,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-08-20 19:46:17','Right breast lump','RIGHT BREAST USS\r\nRight breast was examined using high resolution transducer. \r\nThe right breast showed a large anechoic well-defined mass lesion is noted in retro-areola area with internal turbid contents and solid components. The measure about 40x30mm and 28x27mm in sizes for the cystic and inner solid component respectively. The remaining breast parenchyma ap