.\r\nHowever, overlying soft tissue swelling is noted presumably due to cellulitis/pyomyositis.',NULL,'completed','2026-09-03 13:17:06','2026-09-03 13:17:06','2026-09-03 13:17:06'),(1325,5271,5284,18,NULL,18,NULL,'2026-09-03 13:30:12','Nil','There are calcific density foci noted in the lung fields bilaterally more marked on the right side. \r\nThe pulmonary vasculature is within normal limits\r\nThe costophrenic angles are free.\r\nThe heart is normal in size and contour. CTR = 37/80.\r\nThe bony thorax and overlying soft tissues are within normal limits.','Calcific foci in both lung parenchyma ?post granulomatous disease (PTB)','completed','2026-09-03 13:30:12','2026-09-03 13:30:12','2026-09-03 13:30:12'),(1326,5272,5285,18,NULL,18,NULL,'2026-09-03 13:33:45',NULL,'The heart is normal in size and contour. CTR = 65/115.\r\nThe pulmonary vasculature is within normal limits\r\nNo focal lung parenchymal lesion seen. \r\nThe costophrenic angles are free.\r\nThe bony thorax and overlying soft tissues are within normal limits.','Normal examination','completed','2026-09-03 13:33:45','2026-09-03 13:33:45','2026-09-03 13:33:45'),(1327,5273,5286,18,NULL,18,NULL,'2026-09-03 13:37:45','?Laryngeal spasm.','The heart is normal in size and contour. CTR = 40/98.\r\nThe pulmonary vasculature is within normal limits\r\nNo focal lung parenchymal lesion seen. \r\nThe costophrenic angles are free.\r\nThe bony thorax and overlying soft tissues are within normal limits.','Normal examination','completed','2026-09-03 13:37:45','2026-09-03 13:37:45','2026-09-03 13:37:45'),(1328,5274,5287,18,NULL,18,NULL,'2026-09-03 13:42:02','PID','The liver is normal in size and shows homogenous echotexture. No focal mass lesion is noted. The gall bladder and the biliary tree are also within normal limits. \r\nThe spleen and pancreas show normal size, parenchymal echogenicity and texture with no focal lesion seen within. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and size. They also show normal 