 convincingly demonstrated. No intracavitory fluid collection or gestational sac noted. \r\nThe right adnexium bears an oval well circumscribed hypoechoic lesion with multiple interlacing echogenic septations. It measures about 36x29 mm in size. The left adnexium and POD are within normal limit.','Features are suggestive of ;\r\n1-Right complex adnexal cyst. Hemorrhagic cyst tops the list of differentials.\r\n2- Intramural uterine fibroid.','completed','2026-09-03 18:41:15','2026-09-03 18:41:15','2026-09-03 18:41:15'),(1344,5290,5303,13,NULL,13,NULL,'2026-09-03 18:58:57','?PREGNANCY','The liver is normal in size and outline. It showed normal parenchymal echotexture and echo reflectivity. The hepatic veins are within normal limits.\r\nThe gall bladder is filled with clear bile. It showed regular outline with normal wall thickness. No focal lesion is seen. The biliary ducts are normal in caliber and luminal echoes.\r\nThe spleen is normal in position, outline and parenchymal echo pattern.\r\nThe pancreas is normal in size and parenchymal echo pattern. No focal lesion is seen.\r\nThe bowel loops are normal in caliber and peristalsis. No intra-abdominal mass lesion, ascites or adenopathy is seen. The region of the appendix is within normal limits.\r\nThe kidneys are normal in position, outline and size. They showed normal echopattern with good corticomedullary differentiation. No mass lesion or calculus is seen. The collecting system and ureters are not dilated.\r\nThe urinary bladder is filled with clear urine and showed regular outline with normal wall thickness. No focal lesion is seen.\r\nThe uterus is normal in size and empty. It measures about 36.6mm in widest AP diameter. It shows uniform myometrial echoes and intact endometrial plate. No intracavitory fluid collection or gestational sac noted. \r\nBoth adnexae and POD are within normal limit.','Essentially normal examination. Nil cyesis demonstrated currently.','completed','2026-09-03 18:58:57','2026-09-03 18:50