. No intra-abdominal mass lesion seen.','1. Minimal POD collection ?PID.\r\n2. Enteritis.','completed','2026-09-11 09:35:01','2026-09-11 09:35:01','2026-09-11 09:35:01'),(1643,5596,5613,6,NULL,6,NULL,'2026-09-11 09:37:39','? Cyesis','The uterus is bulky measuring 58mm its widest AP diameter.\r\nThe endometrium contains mixed echo collection about 7ml in volume in the lower uterine segment. The os is closed.\r\nThe myometrial echoes are uniform.\r\nBoth adnexae are free. \r\nThe POD is empty.\r\nThe urinary bladder is within normal limits.\r\nNil else of note','Features consistent with incomplete abortion.','completed','2026-09-11 09:37:39','2026-09-11 09:37:39','2026-09-11 09:37:39'),(1644,5597,5614,6,NULL,6,NULL,'2026-09-11 09:45:06','? Cyesis','The uterus is bulky measuring 60mm its widest AP diameter.\r\nThe endometrium contains mixed echo collection about 10ml in volume. \r\nThe myometrial echoes are uniform.\r\nBoth adnexae are free. \r\nThe POD is empty.\r\nThe urinary bladder is within normal limits.\r\nNil else of note','Features consistent with incomplete abortion.','completed','2026-09-11 09:45:06','2026-09-11 09:45:06','2026-09-11 09:45:06'),(1645,5599,5616,6,NULL,6,NULL,'2026-09-11 09:56:31',NULL,'OBSTETRICS USS    \r\nSingle live intrauterine fetus is demonstrated in longitudinal lie and cephalic presentation. Cardiac activity is good and regular.\r\n Placenta is posterior on the uterine body.\r\nLiquor volume is adequate. \r\nBPD= 94 mm,      FL= 77 mm, HC=350 mm, AC=361 mm.      \r\nEGA= 38 weeks + 6 days, EFW=3918G     \r\nEDD= 19/09/2026\r\nInternal os is closed.','Single viable cyesis at about 38 weeks + 6 days GA in satisfactory well-being.','completed','2026-09-11 09:56:31','2026-09-11 09:56:31','2026-09-11 09:56:31'),(1646,5600,5617,6,NULL,6,NULL,'2026-09-11 10:02:42','Cyesis','OBSTETRICS USS\r\nSingle live,  active intrauterine fetus. Currently breech.\r\nCardiac activity is good. Fetal gross body movements and reflexes are normal.\r\nLiquor vo