ts. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and sizes. They both showed normal echogenicity, good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes bilaterally.\r\nThe spleen is normal in size measuring  and show normal echopattern. No focal mass lesion seen. \r\nThe pancreas is also normal in size and echopattern.  The para-aortic area is free.\r\nThe demonstrated bowel loops appear grossly within normal limits. No intra-abdominal collection seen. \r\nThe urinary bladder is moderately distended with clear urine and showed normal wall thickness. No calculus is demonstrated.\r\nThe uterus is normal in size and measures about 31.0mm in its widest diameter. The endometrial plate is intact. The myometrium shows uniform echoes. Both adnexae and POD are within normal limits.','Essentially normal examination','completed','2026-10-03 16:56:37','2026-10-03 16:56:37','2026-10-03 16:56:37'),(2559,6567,6586,15,NULL,15,NULL,'2026-10-03 17:03:48','? Cyesis','OBSTETRICS USS\r\nSingle live active intrauterine fetus. \r\nIn transverse lie, with head to the left of the maternal spine.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular.\r\nPlacenta is posterior. \r\nAmniotic fluid volume is clear and adequate.\r\nBPD= 44.44mm\r\nFL = 32.22mm\r\nGA= 19 wks + 4 days.\r\nEDD=   23/02/2027.\r\nThe internal os is closed. \r\nNormal hepato-biliary system, pancreas spleen and both kidneys','Single viable fetus at 19 weeks + 4 days GA.','completed','2026-10-03 17:03:48','2026-10-03 17:03:48','2026-10-03 17:03:48'),(2560,6568,6587,15,NULL,15,NULL,'2026-10-03 17:10:17','For fetal well being','OBSTETRICS USS\r\nSingle live active intrauterine fetus. \r\nIn longitudinal lie, cephalic  presentation.\r\nCardiac activity is good and regular.\r\nPlacenta is anterior. \r\nAmniotic fluid volume is clear and adequate.\r\nBPD= 83.58mm\r\nFL = 68.24mm\r\nGA= 34wks + 2days.\r\nEDD=   12/11/2026.\r\nThe internal os is closed. \r\nNormal hepato-biliary system, pancreas spleen and both kidneys','Single viable fetus at 34 weeks + 2 days GA.','completed','2026-10-03 17:10:17','2026-10-03 17:09:56','2026-10-03 17:10:17'),(2561,6569,6588,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-03 18:01:22','? right sided pyelonephritis','The kidneys are normal in size, shape, and outline. However, they showed reduced parenchymal echogenicity, prominent pyramids with increase central sinus fat but the cortico-medullary differentiation is preserved.  No renal mass lesion or calculus seen.\r\nNormal hepato biliary system. \r\nThe pancreas and the para aortic regions are within normal limits. The spleen is normal in size and parenchyma echo pattern.\r\n No intrabdominal mass lesion or collection seen. \r\n The demonstrated bowel loops are grossly intact. \r\nThe urinary bladder is filled with clear urine. It showed regular thickened wall. No calculus is seen. \r\nThe prostate is grossly within normal limits.','Features are suggestive of bilateral pyelonephritis with cystitis as component of UTI.','completed','2026-10-03 18:01:22','2026-10-03 18:01:22','2026-10-03 18:01:22');
INSERT INTO `bill_results` VALUES (2562,6570,6589,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-03 18:12:11','Abdominal pain? cause','The demonstrated bowel loops are prominent and fluid especially in the left flanks showing thickened wall with multiple areas of gas. No focal mass lesion seen. \r\nNo intra-abdominal collection seen. \r\nThe liver is normal sized   and showed normal parenchymal echoes and texture.  No focal hepatic mass lesion or collection demonstrated. The intrahepatic and extra hepatic vascular and biliary systems are within normal limits. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and sizes. They both showed normal echogenicity, good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes bilaterally.\r\nThe spleen is normal in size and show normal echopattern. No focal mass lesion seen. The pancreas is also normal in size and echopattern.  The para aortic area is free.\r\nThe urinary bladder is moderately distended with clear urine and showed normal wall thickness. No calculus is demonstrated.','Features are suggestive of inflammatory bowel changes presumably enterocolitis.\r\nPossibility of partial obstruction cannot be totally rule out. Monitor closely if condition warrants.','completed','2026-10-03 18:12:11','2026-10-03 18:12:11','2026-10-03 18:12:11'),(2563,6571,6590,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-03 18:46:31','?cyesis','The uterus is normal measuring about 40mm in AP diameter. It contains heterogeneous structures about 2.03ml in volume suggestive of product of conception in the lower uterine segment. \r\nThe myometrial echoes are uniform. \r\nThe adnexae and POD are within normal limits. \r\nThe urinary bladder is also within normal limits.','Features are suggestive of Incomplete abortion','completed','2026-10-03 18:46:31','2026-10-03 18:46:31','2026-10-03 18:46:31'),(2564,6572,6591,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-03 18:55:14','? Right knee O.A','There is  spiking of the intercondylar spines and reduction of both medial tibio-femoral and patellofemoral join