s. No calculus is demonstrated.','Features are suggestive of inflammatory bowel changes presumably enteritis.','completed','2026-10-26 20:04:46','2026-10-26 20:04:46','2026-10-26 20:04:46'),(3755,7851,7873,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-26 20:27:00','?PID','The liver is normal sized   and showed normal parenchymal echoes and texture.  No focal hepatic mass lesion or collection demonstrated. The intrahepatic and extra hepatic vascular and biliary systems are within normal limits. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and sizes. They both showed normal echogenicity, good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes bilaterally.\r\nThe spleen is normal in size and show normal echopattern. No focal mass lesion seen. The pancreas is also normal in size and echopattern.  The para aortic area is free.\r\nThe demonstrated bowel loops appear grossly within normal limits.\r\nNo intra-abdominal collection seen. \r\nThe urinary bladder is moderately distended with clear urine and showed normal wall thickness. No calculus is demonstrated. \r\nThe uterus is normal in size and empty measuring about 36.8mm in AP diameter. The endometrial plate is intact about 7.78mm in thickness. The myometrial echoes are uniform. No intra-cavitory  collection, gestational sac or focal mass lesion seen. \r\nThe adnexae are within normal limits. The POD  contains significant fluid collection.','Feature are suggestive of significant POD collection? due to PID.','completed','2026-10-26 20:27:00','2026-10-26 20:27:00','2026-10-26 20:27:00'),(3756,7850,7872,5,NULL,5,NULL,'2026-10-26 20:30:13','?Goitre','The thyroid gland is normal in size and shows uniform echotexture. \r\nNo focal lesion is demonstrated within it. \r\nThe demonstrated salivary glands appear within normal limits. \r\nThe strap muscles and blood vessels show normal appearances. \r\nNo focal mass lesion or collection demonstrated. \r\nNormal overlying skin.','Normal neck soft tissue examination.  Further eva