d. The uterus is normal in size and showed uniform myometrial echoes with intact endometrial plate. No cyesis or RPOC seen. The adnexae  is free. The POD contain mild free fluid presumably reactionary.','Normal sonographic findings. (Complete abortion)\r\nNil cyesis.','completed','2026-10-28 18:25:03','2026-10-28 18:25:03','2026-10-28 18:25:03'),(3849,7945,7967,14,NULL,14,NULL,'2026-10-28 18:31:24','CYESIS','OBSTETRICS ULTRASOUND SCAN REPORT\r\nSingle live intrauterine fetus in longitudinal lie and cephalic presentation currently. `\r\ncardiac activity is present and regular. \r\nNo gross fetal anomaly is seen. 	\r\nPlacenta is posterior on the uterine body. \r\nLiquor volume is adequate and clear.\r\nBPD = 51.7 mm, FL = 34.7 mm\r\nEGA=  21 weeks + 1 day, \r\nEDD = 09/03/2027\r\nThe internal os is closed.','Single viable intrauterine gestation at about 21weeks + 1 day GA in satisfactory well-being.','completed','2026-10-28 18:31:24','2026-10-28 18:31:24','2026-10-28 18:31:24'),(3850,7946,7968,14,NULL,14,NULL,'2026-10-28 18:37:15','cyesis','OBSTETRICS USS\r\n\r\nSingleton intrauterine fetus.\r\nIn longitudinal lie but breech presentation.\r\nNo cardiac activity or fetal movement seen is seen throughout the period of the examination collapse of fetal skull. \r\nAmniotic fluid volume is reduced\r\nPlacenta is posterior in the body. \r\nInternal cervical os closed.\r\nFL= 30 mm  \r\nGA= 19 weeks 2 days.','Features are suggestive of Intrauterine fetal demise at about 19 weeks + 2 days GA.','completed','2026-10-28 18:37:15','2026-10-28 18:37:15','2026-10-28 18:37:15'),(3851,7947,7969,14,NULL,14,NULL,'2026-10-28 18:42:30','CYESIS','OBSTETRICS ULTRASOUND SCAN REPORT\r\n\r\nSingle live intrauterine fetus in longitudinal lie but breech presentation currently. `\r\ncardiac activity is present and regular. \r\nNo gross fetal anomaly is seen. 	\r\nPlacenta is posterior on the uterine body. \r\nLiquor volume is adequate and clear.\r\nBPD = 43.6 mm, FL =  23.6 mm\r\nEGA=  18 weeks