mal in position, outline and size. They showed normal echo pattern with good corticomedullary differentiation. No mass lesion or calculus is seen. The collecting system and ureters are not dilated.\r\nThe urinary bladder is filled with clear urine and showed regular outline with normal wall thickness. No focal lesion is seen.\r\nThe prostate gland is normal in size, outline and echo pattern. No focal lesion is seen.','Normal examination. Further clinical evaluation is advised to rule out pyelonephritis.','completed','2026-10-30 18:29:43','2026-10-30 18:29:43','2026-10-30 18:29:43'),(3969,8070,8093,12,NULL,12,NULL,'2026-10-30 18:48:51','ABDOMINOPELVIC USS','The liver is normal in size and outline. It showed normal parenchymal echotexture and echo reflectivity. The hepatic veins are within normal limits. No focal hepatic parenchymal lesion is seen.\r\nThe gall bladder is filled with clear bile. It showed regular outline with normal wall thickness. No focal lesion is seen. The biliary ducts are normal in caliber and luminal echoes.\r\nThe spleen is normal in position, outline and parenchymal echo pattern. The pancreas is also normal in size and parenchymal echo pattern. No focal lesion is seen.\r\nThe bowel loops are normal in caliber and peristalsis. No intra-abdominal mass lesion, ascites or adenopathy is seen. The region of the appendix is within normal limits.\r\nThe right kidney is ectopic and seen in the right iliac fossa. The left kidney is normal in position. Both kidneys are normal in position, outline and size. They showed normal echo pattern with good corticomedullary differentiation. No mass lesion or calculus is seen. The collecting system and ureters are not dilated.\r\nThe urinary bladder is filled with clear urine and showed regular outline with normal wall thickness. No focal lesion is seen.','Ectopic right kidney seen in the right iliac fossa otherwise normal examination.\r\nPlain abdominal X-ray is advised','completed','2026-10-30 18:48:51','2026-10-