 free','Conclusion: Features are suggestive of Right Renal Ectopic Kidney with Bilateral Pyelonephritis.\r\n                     IVU is necessary for further evaluation.','2026-09-07 08:40:50','2026-09-07 08:40:50'),(468,17,'OBS CRL 2',NULL,'Bulky uterus containing a single intact gestational sac with a live fetal pole\r\nRegular cardiac pulsation is demonstrated \r\nBPD= 28.9mm   CRL= 86.1mm,   GA= 15weeks + 0days\r\nEDD= 01/03/27  \r\nBoth adnexae are free. The POD is empty. \r\nThe internal os is closed.','Conclusion:  Early Viable Intrauterine Cyesis at 15weeks GA.','2026-09-07 10:18:01','2026-09-07 10:18:01'),(469,17,'Pelvis Uss Infertilty',NULL,'The uterus is normal sized and empty measuring about 39.1mm in AP diameter.  \r\nThe myometral echoes are uniform. The endometrial plate is intact. \r\nBoth adnexae are demonstrated and are within normal limits with no masses or cysts seen.\r\nThe POD is empty. \r\nThe urinary bladder contains clear urine and shows normal wall thickness and regular          outline','Conclusion; Normal Examination. HSG, TVS, Hormonal Assay / Sperm Count are Advice for Infertility.','2026-09-07 12:41:49','2026-09-07 12:41:49'),(470,17,'Abdomen Uss Gaseous Distention',NULL,'The liver is normal sized and showed normal parenchymal echoes and texture. No focal hepatic mass lesion or collection demonstrated. The intrahepatic and extra-hepatic vascular and biliary systems are within normal limits. \r\nThe gallbladder is normal in caliber and shows regular outline and wall thickness. No calculus is seen. The spleen and the pancreas are also normal in size and echo pattern. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in their positions, outlines and sizes. They both showed normal echogenicity, good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes bilaterally. \r\nThere are dilated bowel loop with increase peristaltic. No intrabdominal mass seen\r\nThe urinary bladder is normal in caliber and shows clear content, normal wall thickness and outlin