es suggest acute prostatitis with ? rectal mass. Barium enema advised.\r\n2. UTI (cystitis, bilateral pyelonephritis).','2026-10-06 10:27:01','2026-10-06 10:27:01'),(680,6,'abd RPOC','? Cyesis','The uterus is normal in size and empty measuring 66mm its widest AP diameter.\r\nThe endometrium contains mixed echo collection about 10ml. No cyesis demonstrated.\r\nThe myometrial echoes are uniform.\r\nBoth adnexae are free. \r\nThe POD is empty.\r\nThe urinary bladder is within normal limits.\r\nNil else of note','Features consistent with residual post-abortal collection.','2026-10-06 10:53:19','2026-10-06 10:53:19'),(681,6,'abd f non-uterus','Fibroid','Abdominal Uss.\r\nThe uterus is not convincingly demonstrated? cause. The adnexae are within normal limits. The POD is free.\r\nThe urinary bladder contains clear urine with normal wall thickness and regular outline.\r\nNormal hepatobiliary system, the spleen and pancreas. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in size, shape, and outline. They have good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes. \r\nThe visualized bowel loops show normal peristalsis and wall thickness. No mesenteric adenopathy noted. No intra-abdominal mass lesion seen.','Non-demonstration of uterus? cause. Further gynaecological evaluation advised.','2026-10-06 11:58:07','2026-10-06 11:58:07'),(682,6,'abd rt mass, non uterus','?','Abdominal Uss.\r\nA large hypoechoic lesion is noted in the right hemi-abdomen. it measures about 34x32mm in size.  No calcification is noted. Mild peri-lesional collection is noted. The left adnexium is within normal limits. The POD contains mild free fluid. The uterus is not convincingly demonstrated.\r\nThe urinary bladder contains clear urine with normal wall thickness and regular outline.\r\nNormal hepatobiliary system, the spleen and pancreas. \r\nThe kidneys are normal in size, shape, and outline. They have good cortico-medullary differentiation and normal central sinus echoes. \r\nThe visualized bowel loops